## Alternative trackers

### YouTrack

Environment variables:
- `YOUTRACK_URL` — base URL (e.g. `https://youtrack.example.com`)
- `YOUTRACK_TOKEN` — Bearer token for the YouTrack API (required)

### Jira

Environment variables:
- `JIRA_URL` — base URL (e.g. `https://yourcompany.atlassian.net`)
- `JIRA_TOKEN` — API token (required)
- `JIRA_EMAIL` — email for Jira Cloud (optional, for basic auth)
